---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Graphic design & visual identity | SEZMOO"
  description="Graphic design and visual systems by SEZMOO: identities and advertising material that stay consistent across digital, print and packaging. Gdańsk, Poland."
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Graphic <span style="color:#ffd200">design.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1"><b>Consistent communication starts with a system</b>, not with a single graphic.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">We build visual identities and advertising material that can be developed consistently across digital, print and everything that comes next.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Digital</span><strong>Social · ads · web</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Print</span><strong>Catalogues · POS · large format</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Base</span><strong>Identity and key visual</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Files</span><strong>Source and production-ready</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1" style="background:transparent;border:0;aspect-ratio:16/10">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/grafika-znakownia-imac-92c2fe20-1280.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/grafika-znakownia-imac-92c2fe20-800.webp 800w, /assets/optimized/lcp/grafika-znakownia-imac-92c2fe20-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="100vw" width="1280" height="1118" alt="Znakownia – logo design in Adobe Illustrator" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" style="object-fit:contain;object-position:center;padding:0 0 4%;box-sizing:border-box" />
    <figcaption style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Znakownia</b><span>Logo design</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we do</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Visual identity</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We build visual identity systems from scratch and develop existing brands – from the logo and key visual to the rules that keep every later piece consistent.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Logo design</span><span>Visual identity</span><span>Key visual</span><span>Brand book</span><span>Logo guidelines</span><span>Typography</span><span>Brand colours</span><span>Logo refresh</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Marketing &amp; advertising material</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Material for campaigns, sales and everyday communication – for use online and in print alike.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Ad banners</span><span>Catalogues</span><span>Brochures</span><span>Leaflets</span><span>Posters</span><span>Presentations</span><span>E-books</span><span>Infographics</span><span>POS material</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Social media &amp; digital</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Graphics for online communication, digital campaigns and social media – single pieces of creative as well as consistent systems for regular publishing.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Social media</span><span>Meta Ads</span><span>Google Display</span><span>Web banners</span><span>Carousels</span><span>Stories</span><span>Campaign key visual</span><span>Design templates</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Packaging &amp; product</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Packaging, labels and product material designed around the brand identity and the realities of production.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Packaging</span><span>Labels</span><span>Stickers</span><span>Boxes</span><span>Product material</span><span>Mockups</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>2D &amp; 3D graphics</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Illustration, visualisation and 2D/3D graphics used in campaigns, decks, advertising material and digital.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Illustration</span><span>2D graphics</span><span>3D graphics</span><span>Visualisations</span><span>Mockups</span><span>Infographics</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Print &amp; production files</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Typesetting, file preparation, format adaptations and production material – artwork leaves us ready for the press.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>DTP</span><span>Typesetting</span><span>Print preparation</span><span>Format adaptations</span><span>Production files</span><span>Large format</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Design <span style="color:#ffd200">capabilities.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Branding</h3><p>Logos, visual identity, key visuals and graphic systems.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Digital</h3><p>Social media, paid campaigns, display and material for websites.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Print</h3><p>Catalogues, brochures, posters, POS material and print-ready artwork.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>2D / 3D</h3><p>Illustration, infographics, visualisations and spatial graphics.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>DTP and production</h3><p>Typesetting, file preparation, format adaptations and production material.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-format">
      <h3 class="fmt-lead reveal">One graphic system,<br />many points of <span style="color:#ffd200">contact.</span></h3>
      <p class="fmt-p reveal">A campaign key visual can end up in social media, digital advertising, a catalogue, POS material or outdoor advertising.</p>
      <p class="fmt-p reveal">That is why we design not only for the first piece of creative, but for everything it will later be adapted into.</p>
      <div class="fmt-wrap">
        <div class="fmt2 reveal">
          <div class="fmt2__hud"><span><span class="dot"></span>1 key visual</span><span>Digital · print · OOH · POS</span></div>
          <div class="fmt2__master">
            <div class="fmt2__sprk"></div>
            <div class="fmt2__frames"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="fmt2__sprk"></div>
            <span class="fmt2__mlbl">MASTER · key visual and system</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fmt2__split">where the design has to work</div>
          <div class="fmt2__outs">
            <div class="fmt2__out"><span class="fmt2__shape s-11"></span><div><span class="r">Social · display · web</span><h4>Digital</h4></div></div>
            <div class="fmt2__out"><span class="fmt2__shape s-916"></span><div><span class="r">Catalogue · leaflet · poster</span><h4>Print</h4></div></div>
            <div class="fmt2__out"><span class="fmt2__shape s-ban"></span><div><span class="r">Billboard · citylight · banner</span><h4>OOH</h4></div></div>
            <div class="fmt2__out"><span class="fmt2__shape s-169"></span><div><span class="r">Stand · sticker · sales material</span><h4>POS</h4></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fmt-copy reveal">
          <span class="fmt-copy__kick"><i></i>Adaptations</span>
          <h4 class="fmt-copy__title">Bring the subject.<br />We'll pick the formats.</h4>
          <p class="fmt-copy__p">You don't have to know upfront how many formats you need. We start from the goal and the places the material has to work – the rest is adaptation of the same system.</p>
          <a class="fmt-copy__cta" href="/en/#kontakt">Let's talk about the project →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-primespot/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/primespot/pjur-blue-square-1.jpg" alt="PrimeSpot – Creative · Campaign" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Creative · Campaign</span><h3>PrimeSpot ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/szymichowski/szymichowski-pruszcz-park-katalog-inwestycji-01.avif" alt="Szymichowski – Catalogue · Print" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Catalogue · Print</span><h3>Szymichowski ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-soho-form/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/soho-form/soho-cover.webp" alt="Soho Form – Logo · Brand manual" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Logo · Brand manual</span><h3>Soho Form ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
